      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-22T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "On 22 November 2026, the United Nations said the conference collapsed after two days of overtime negotiations.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1387272971:3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-22T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "The conference, known as COP31, was held at the Expo Center in Antalya, Turkey.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1387272971:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-22T00:00:33Z",
      "text": "The conference is dated 2026, and it began on 9 November 2026.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q115379423:P585",
        "wd:Q115379423:P580"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-22T00:00:52Z",
      "text": "Al Jazeera headlined its story, \"COP31 climate talks on the brink as new draft deal faces scrutiny.\"",
      "cites": [
